WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.168
-We're about to do
something fun,

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.336
but I'm going to need some help.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:06.305
So joining me now
is the star of "The J Team,"

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:08.441
which is out now
on Paramount Plus,

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:11.578
the one and only JoJo Siwa!

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:13.179
Yeah!

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:14.947
-Yeah!

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:16.749
How you doing?
-Oh, I love you, buddy.

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:18.350
-Oh!
-JoJo!

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.254
-J Team! "The J Team."

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.788
That's what I'm talking about.
-Yeah!

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:24.290
-Thank you so much
for being here.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.858
JoJo, whenever
you're on the show,

00:00:25.858 --> 00:00:28.428
I like to challenge you
in the form of dance.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:29.862
And we've done a dance battle --

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:31.731
We've done an aggressive
dance battle.

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.067
But this time, I think
the question on everyone's mind

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.302
is -- is who's
the faster dancer?

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.337
-I'm -- I'm getting old
to do this.

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:40.440
-No, you are -- Please,
you're talking to Grandpa here.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.875
-Going to break a bone
this time.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:45.011
-Let's find out. It's time for
a "Tonight Show Fast Dance-Off."

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:46.946
-♪ "Tonight Show" dance,
"Tonight Show" fast dance-off ♪

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:52.051
♪ "Tonight Show" fast dance,
dance, dance, dance-off ♪

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:54.119
-Oxygen tank's on standby,
right?

00:00:54.119 --> 00:00:55.388
-Here we go, come on.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.890
We're going to take turns
dancing as fast as we can.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:01.427
But to make things fun, we will
not be dancing to fast songs.

00:01:01.427 --> 00:01:02.995
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:05.965
We'll be dancing to the slowest,
least danceable songs

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.299
we could think of.

00:01:07.299 --> 00:01:09.469
JoJo, since you're my guest,
why don't you go first?

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:12.372
Hit the Fast Dance Generator
button whenever you are ready.

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.140
-I've been waiting for this one!

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.509 line:0%
-[ Beeping ]

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.945 line:0%
-Always wanted
to press that button.

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:20.780 line:0%
-Okay.
-Oh!

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.214 line:0%
Got a little Olivia.

00:01:22.214 --> 00:01:23.449 line:0%
-Olivia Rodrigo, okay.

00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:25.251 line:0%
-Alright, I like it.
-Alright, well, go for it.

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:26.686 line:0%
Whenever you're ready,
hit the floor, man.

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:28.321 line:0%
Let's see what you got.
-Oh, this is scary.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.790 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:32.758 --> 00:01:34.260 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.862 line:0%
-♪ And I know
we weren't perfect ♪

00:01:36.862 --> 00:01:43.102
♪ But I've never felt this way
for no one ♪

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:46.739
♪ Oh, and I just can't imagine ♪

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:53.780
♪ How you could be so okay
now that I'm gone ♪

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.581
♪ I guess you didn't mean ♪

00:01:55.581 --> 00:02:00.820
♪ What you wrote in that song
about me ♪

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:05.658
♪ 'Cause you said forever, now I
drive alone past your street ♪

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:08.094
-Oh! Come on, now.

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:10.095
That's --

00:02:10.095 --> 00:02:12.498
That's -- That is
a professional.

00:02:12.498 --> 00:02:14.100
-I lost so many things
out of my hair.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.335
-Yeah, you had --
Yeah, this barrette came out.

00:02:16.335 --> 00:02:18.271
That is a professional
right there.

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:21.507
I don't even know why I would
even try to beat that, but --

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:23.309
Amazing. JoJo Siwa.
Come on, that's --

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:25.345
-Thank you.

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:27.113
-Alright.

00:02:27.113 --> 00:02:29.048
Now it is my turn.
-Oh.

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.550
-Let's see what I get here.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.919 line:0%
[ Beeping ]

00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:36.823 line:0%
[ Laughter, cheering ]

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:38.391 line:0%
"Someone You Loved." Okay, yeah.

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:39.992 line:0%
-Have a blast with that one.

00:02:39.992 --> 00:02:41.594 line:0%
