What's "Someone You Loved"?

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:42.928 line:0%
Oh, Lewis Capaldi.

00:02:42.928 --> 00:02:44.797 line:0%
[ Singing indistinctly ]

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:47.133 line:0%
-[ Singing indistinctly ]

00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:51.604 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Get it.

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:57.910 line:0%
-♪ I guess I kind of like the
way you numbed all the pain ♪

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:02.315
♪ Now the day bleeds
into nightfall ♪

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:06.418
♪ And you're not here
to get me through it all ♪

00:03:06.418 --> 00:03:08.621
♪ I let my guard down ♪
-Oh.

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:11.057
-♪ And then you pulled the rug ♪

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:15.661
