00:03:20.132 --> 00:03:24.737 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:32.778
What in the land of --
just happened?

00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:34.814
-I'm hurting in all
weird places right now.

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:36.282
-It's alright. It's alright.

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:37.650
-JoJo, it is your turn again.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.919
